context: |
  PolylineDecorator walks the whole line from the first point and stops at
  500 arrows. Redraw runs on zoomend only. On a long track the visible
  part can have no arrows, or arrows aimed along an off-screen chord.
  S87 viewport spacing stays. Bearing stays screen atan2 + 90 on the
  north-up icon.

steps:
  1. Place arrows only on segments that intersect the padded viewport.
     Spend the 500 cap inside that viewport, not from the track start.
  2. Redraw on moveend and zoomend. Remove markers in cleanup.
  3. Keep TARGET_SPACING_PX as the density. Do not let full-track pixel
     length widen the gap when zoomed in.
  4. Check history segment arrows and the tracking polyline. Same component.

out:
  - src/features/map/components/PolylineDecorator.tsx

done:
  - Zoomed-in and panned track shows arrows along the visible direction.
  - Arrow count stays within 500.
  - Pan and zoom do not leave detached arrow markers.
